@PointClass base(NuclideIO, BulwarkScripted) color(255 128 192) size(-8 -8 -8, 8 8 8) = env_xenmaker : "env_xenmaker (Sven Co-op): a Xen teleport effect, with lightning beams, sprites and a sound, that can bring in a monster. m_flStartSpriteScale/Framerate/Alpha, m_vStartSpriteColor first sprite m_flEndSpriteScale/Framerate/Alpha, m_vEndSpriteColor second sprite A squadmaker with a 'xenmaker' key plays this effect each time it spawns a child (its own monstertype is used then, not this one's). Not done yet: the light (m_flLightRadius, m_vLightColor) and spawnflags. Scripted entity: scripts/vscripts/entities/env_xenmaker.lua, spawned by Bulwark's ncScriptedEntity when no QC class has this classname."
