@SolidClass base(NuclideIO, BrushCompile, BulwarkScripted) color(0 128 204) = func_breakable : "Brush volume that can break into lots of little pieces. Notes: The strength of the explosion decides the radius (magnitude * 2.5) and the maximum damage the explosion will do in the center. It has a linear fall-off. Material-list: - 0 : Glass - 1 : Wood - 2 : Metal - 3 : Flesh - 4 : Cinder - 5 : Tile - 6 ; Computer - 7 : Glass (Unbreakable) - 8 : Rock - 9 : None"
[
