@SolidClass base(NuclideIO, BrushCompile, BulwarkScripted) color(0 128 204) = func_detail : "A 'fake' entity for level editors. All geometry that's turned into a func_detail will be ignored during VIS. This will speed up compile time and reduce tesselation, in theory. Notes: If you don't want this entity to have collision, consider using func_detail_illusionary."
