@SolidClass base(NuclideIO, BrushCompile, BulwarkScripted) color(0 128 204) = func_vehicle : "Primitive brush-based vehicle entity. Notes: The vehicle's position is set via the 'target' key, which sets the first path_track/corner. The vehicle is then teleported to the 'target' but it stays at the same vertical position as originally placed. The angle is calculated by aiming the 'target' path_track/corner entity to its own 'target' entity. So yes, you need two of these path_track/corner entities."
