@PointClass base(NuclideIO, BulwarkScripted, Def_hlWeapon) color(76 76 255) size(-16 -16 -16, 16 16 16) model("models/w_357.mdl") = weapon_357 : ".357 Revolver. entityDef spawned as hlWeapon. Half-Life specific weapon based on ncWeapon. Notes: Both `ammoIcon` and `crosshair` refer to sprite declarations inside the sprites/ directory. FreeHL scans the `sprites/hud.txt` file and and weapon specific files. Since the weapon specific files only contain short names like `ammo` and `crosshair` you have to refer to them with a prefix separated by a `.` period symbol. For example, `ammoIcon` being set to `weapon_foobar.ammo` will look up `ammo` inside `sprites/weapon_foobar.txt`."
[
]

