@PointClass base(NuclideIO, BulwarkScripted) color(0 0 204) size(-16 -16 0, 16 16 32) model("models/models/w_weaponbox.mdl") = weaponbox : "HALF-LIFE (1998) ENTITY Ammo container. Used to delvier more than 1 singular ammo type, as well as more precise control. -------- KEYS -------- 'targetname' : Name 'uranium' : Amount of Uranium (Egon, Gauss) ammo to give '357' : Amount of 357 Python ammo to give '9mm' : Amount of 9mm Handgun/MP5 ammo to give 'ARgrenades' : Amount of MP5 grenades to give 'bolts' : Amount of Crossbow bolts 'buckshot' : Amount of Shotgun ammo to give 'rockets' : Amount of RPG ammo to give '556' : (Oppossing Force only) Amount for the SAW Machine Gun '762' : (Oppossing Force only) Amount for the Sniper Rifle 'spore' : (Oppossing Force only) Amount for the Spore Launcher"
[
]

